### 通过网关查询图书（与直接调用book-product的响应一致）
GET http://localhost:8090/api/products/1

### 自动路由
GET http://localhost:8090/book-product/api/products/1

### 通过网关查询用户
GET http://localhost:8090/api/users/1

### 通过网关查询订单
GET http://localhost:8090/api/orders/1

### 使用StripPrefix
GET http://localhost:8090/product-service/api/products/1

### 使用RewritePath
GET http://localhost:8090/api/v1/products/1

### GET请求
GET http://localhost:8090/api/orders/1

### POST请求
POST http://localhost:8090/api/orders

### DELETE请求
DELETE http://localhost:8090/api/orders/1

### 正常
GET http://localhost:8090/api/products/search?keyword=Spring

### 无keyword
GET http://localhost:8090/api/products/search

### 空值
GET http://localhost:8090/api/products/search?keyword=

### 无X-Admin-Token
POST http://localhost:8090/api/products

### 携带X-Admin-Token: any
POST http://localhost:8090/api/products
X-Admin-Token: any

### 携带X-Admin-Token
GET http://localhost:8090/api/products
X-Admin-Token: any

### 消息头过滤器验证
http://localhost:8090/api/products/1